EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hey hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Thanks for braving the
cold to come visit me!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What do you think of this town?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I think it's pretty neat!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Oye, gracias por ignorar el frío
para venir a visitarme! A mí ya
me costó salir de la cama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bueno, {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿y qué te parece el pueblo?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No me dirás que no es la pera
limonera.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Che bello!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hai sfidato tutto questo
freddo per venirmi a trovare!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Che ne pensi di questa città?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A me piace un sacco!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Do you visit this town a lot?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}This is the sort of place{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} you wanna
visit over and over, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Sueles venir mucho por aquí?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Yo creo que es un sitio que mola
mucho visitar una o mil veces!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu kasabaya sık gelir misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burası insanın{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} tekrar tekrar gelmek
isteyeceği türden, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I wonder if my stew is done yet!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I'd better let it cook a little longer.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Then it'll be extra good,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehi, ciao!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ho scelto {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
a caso guardando la mappa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ora mi sono accampato qui.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Questo posto mi piace un sacco!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono stato proprio fortunato
a trovarlo!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Non so quanto potrò restare,
ma vedrai che ci beccheremo
di nuovo qui da qualche parte!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sei di queste parti?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} Mitico!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che ne pensi di questo igloo?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Certo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} fa molto freddo qui dentro.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Per questo mi sto preparando
un bello stufato!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}All'inizio non ero convintissimo
fosse una buona idea passare
l'inverno fuori casa...
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}... invece è molto divertente!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Resterò da queste parti per un po'.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Spero di rivederti ancora!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}No matter what, I'm gonna live
somewhere that has tons of food,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich ziehe wohin, wo es viel gutes
Essen gibt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ist das Wichtigste,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Äh, he he he.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Right now, I'm just camping here,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but pretty soon I'll be moving to
this town!
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} invited me, actually.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We should hang out once I'm moved
in,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Momentan bin ich nur zum Campen
hier, aber bald ziehe ich ganz um.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mich eingeladen.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wenn der Umzug vorbei ist, musst
du mich unbedingt mal besuchen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ja,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Oh! Ehm, non so se lo sapevi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} mi ha invitato{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
a venire a vivere in questa città!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Da ora in poi saremo vicini di casa!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ci si vede in giro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kendi kamp ateşini yakmak biraz uğraştırıyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}
Ama bir kez tutuştu mu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sıcacık ve mis gibi,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ne zaman kamp yapsam,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} eskiden hayat herhâlde
böyleydi diye düşünüyorum. {{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ne kadar rahat.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bayılıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Il mio stufato è davvero buono!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Non lo dico per vantarmi, eh.
Ne mangerei una tonnellata!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've camped in a lot of different
places, but this town is really
special.
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}In fact,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} it might even be the{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} best{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
town{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ever!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Actually, it definitely is,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I kinda wanna live
here!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
You should move here!
Uh...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Estoy de un depre que ni te cuento.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Con lo ultraguay que es este pueblo,
y en breve me tengo que abrir.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000E:}}¡No es justo! Aquí me lo estaba
pasando pirata{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Pues quédate a vivir!
Menos drama y a casa

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Caspitina, sono un po' giù, sai?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Questa città mi piace tanto,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma mi toccherà andarmene presto...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000E:}}Sob! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Non voglio andare
via,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Trasferisciti qui!
Ah, poverino...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Dün gece bu kasabada yaşadığım komik bir
rüya gördüm!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hem de bayağı keyfim
yerindeydi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Söylesene, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sen de benim düşündüğümü mü düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
Güzel rüyaymış!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Well, I really love this town.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Camping here has been a lot of fun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Je me plais vraiment beaucoup ici !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu peux pas savoir combien je
me suis amusé, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ben bu kasabayı gerçekten sevdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burada kamp yapmak çok eğlenceliydi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
